 - [ ] **REG-003**: When a snapshot has an invalid signature, an unsupported schema version, or duplicate serial numbers, the system SHALL reject the import and retain the active snapshot.
 - [ ] **REG-004**: When a valid replacement snapshot is activated, the system SHALL expose all of its records together without exposing a partially imported snapshot.
+- [ ] **REG-005**: When a snapshot passes validation, the system SHALL build a fresh SQLite index from that snapshot's records and activate it by atomic file rename, rather than patching the previously active index.
+- [ ] **REG-006**: When the active SQLite index file is missing or cannot be opened, the system SHALL fail serial-number lookups with an error and SHALL NOT return records from any other source.
